{"tool_name":"nuclearquant","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>NuclearQuant is a <a href=\"https://biii.eu/quantcenter\">QuantCenter</a>&nbsp;module. It is designed for cell nuclei detection and quantification of IHC stained samples. NuclearQuant measures several morphological features besides stain intensity. The cell nuclei classification and the final score are calculated by the intensity score and the proportion score.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>NuclearQuant is a <a href=\"https://biii.eu/quantcenter\">QuantCenter</a>&nbsp;module. It is designed for cell nuclei detection and quantification of IHC stained samples. NuclearQuant measures several morphological features besides stain intensity. The cell nuclei classification and the final score are calculated by the intensity score and the proportion score.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-26T14:11:36+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:43+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4602,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"dd040d9e-87f9-401b-9263-00ac519de9bd","url":"/taxonomy/term/4602"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505206763,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":4846,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"767a7d66-a7ae-47e4-b2cd-5730124d2a36","url":"/taxonomy/term/4846"},{"target_id":4583,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"ec977c08-a2fd-4abc-98ca-f1831465815f","url":"/taxonomy/term/4583"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":19,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"a8a58b02-2abc-4749-8aea-b9a6e7086874","url":"/user/19"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4083,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid"